      "position": [
        0,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "Direct research stages: company footprint($0.03), vendor health($0.10), ATS jobs($0.01). Optional private tech lookup($0.02 single) is disabled by default; Trial/Sandbox do not cover it. It hides the target from facilitator metadata only. The later direct calls remain visible to their facilitators. Select only evidence needed; checks overlap. Public estimates are not financial forecasts or credit ratings.\nManual trigger only. Sandbox defaults cost $0; real inputs use quota or x402. No wallet signing, checkout or outreach. HTTP errors halt the workflow. Review inputs before running.",
